### 1. Health Check - Test API Nyala atau Nggak
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

###

### 2. Get All Clocks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clocks

###

### 3. Get Clocks by User ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clocks/user/user123

###

### 4. Create Clock - Clock In
POST http://localhost:8080/api/clocks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "user123",
  "check_clock_type": "in"
}

###

### 5. Create Clock - Clock Out
POST http://localhost:8080/api/clocks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "user123",
  "check_clock_type": "out"
}

###

### 6. Delete Clock (ganti ID sesuai data kamu)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/clocks/1